<title>FRANCE: EU rye flour export refund 31.50 Ecus.</title>
<headline>EU rye flour export refund 31.50 Ecus.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union has set a standing refund  for rye flour exports to third countries of 31.50 Ecus per tonne,  Brussels-based Coceral, which liaises with the Commission for the  grain industry, said on Friday.</p>
<p>The EU has also set its refund standing on barley exports to Switzerland  and Liechtenstein at two Ecus, it noted.</p>
</text>
